//image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQhFoqby8UYq4uGQXOtV7P8JLBl.jpg", "rating": 6.035, "year": "2015", "overview": "Through a series of misunderstandings, Alvin, Simon and Theodore come to believe that Dave is going to propose to his new girlfriend in New York City - and dump them. They have three days to get to him and stop the proposal.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V8_W5cZWLZY", "tmdb_id": 258509, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 901362, "title": "Trolls Band Together", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ySgD2xwasTHOK6R9bNZiEwKgYo.jpg", "rating": 7.245, "year": "2023", "overview": "When Branch's brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vDrUY5sZFds", "tmdb_id": 901362, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 18491, "title": "Neon Genesis Evangelion: The End of Evangelion", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6G24dqI4WgUtChhWjfnI4lnmiK.jpg", "rating": 8.266, "year": "1997", "overview": "SEELE orders an all-out attack on NERV, aiming to destroy the Evas before Gendo can advance his own plans for the Human Instrumentality Project. Shinji is pushed to the limits of his sanity as he is forced to decide the fate of humanity.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J8t48KMGCo4", "tmdb_id": 18491, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 635302, "title": "Demon Slayer -Kimetsu no Yaiba- The Movie: Mugen Train", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8Rb9gBr48ODIwYUttZNYeMWeUU.jpg", "rating": 8.234, "year": "2020", "overview": "Tanjiro Kamado, joined with Inosuke Hashibira, a boy raised by boars who wears a boar's head, and Zenitsu Agatsuma, a scared boy who reveals his true power when he sleeps, boards the Infinity Train on a new mission with the Fire Hashira, Kyojuro Rengoku, to defeat a demon who has been tormenting the people and killing the demon slayers who oppose it!", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v30H0qj_b9E", "tmdb_id": 635302, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 9732, "title": "The Lion King II: Simba's Pride", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWR1x6UCMCGN9xEf8RGhPS934X0.jpg", "rating": 6.939, "year": "1998", "overview": "The circle of life continues for Simba, now fully grown and in his rightful place as the king of Pride Rock. Simba and Nala have given birth to a daughter, Kiara who's as rebellious as her father was. But Kiara drives her parents to distraction when she catches the eye of Kovu, the son of the evil lioness, Zira. Will Kovu steal Kiara's heart?", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gxrwh6WNMLU", "tmdb_id": 9732, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 12092, "title": "Alice in Wonderland", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20cvfwfaFqNbe9Fc3VEHJuPRxmn.jpg", "rating": 7.197, "year": "1951", "overview": "On a golden afternoon, wildly curious young Alice tumbles into the burrow and enters the merry, madcap world of Wonderland full of whimsical escapades.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JY2rHymtNvc", "tmdb_id": 12092, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 9982, "title": "Chicken Little", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87FpA4b90eTaw3U6zmCNikoPLir.jpg", "rating": 5.923, "year": "2005", "overview": "When the sky really is falling and sanity has flown the coop, who will rise to save the day? Together with his hysterical band of misfit friends, Chicken Little must hatch a plan to save the planet from alien invasion and prove that the world's biggest hero is a little chicken.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=POAACdKjsn0", "tmdb_id": 9982, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 839033, "title": "The Lord of the Rings: The War of the Rohirrim", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23WCoDo6wzBfzbX7BGTNwVUqZfi.jpg", "rating": 6.501, "year": "2024", "overview": "A sudden attack by Wulf, a clever and traitorous lord of Rohan seeking vengeance for the death of his father, forces Helm Hammerhand, the King of Rohan, and his people to make a daring last stand in the ancient stronghold of the Hornburg.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9FlsJqDox5M", "tmdb_id": 839033, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 10895, "title": "Pinocchio", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnZJrLRnoQHpzEJdka1KYfsAF3N.jpg", "rating": 7.117, "year": "1940", "overview": "When the gentle woodcarver Geppetto builds a marionette to be his substitute son, a benevolent fairy brings the toy to life. The puppet, named Pinocchio, is not yet a human boy. He must earn the right to be real by proving that he is brave, truthful, and unselfish.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_xHYzf_rdGU", "tmdb_id": 10895, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 774370, "title": "Dog Man", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89wNiexZdvLQ41OQWIsQy4O6jAQ.jpg", "rating": 7.373, "year": "2025", "overview": "When a faithful police dog and his human police officer owner are injured together on the job, a harebrained but life-saving surgery fuses the two of them together and Dog Man is born. Dog Man is sworn to protect and serve—and fetch, sit and roll over. As Dog Man embraces his new identity and strives to impress his Chief, he must stop the pretty evil plots of feline supervillain Petey the Cat.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QaJbAennB_Q", "tmdb_id": 774370, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 46195, "title": "Rio", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nJxhUknKV8Gqdhov8pU1YWDYfb.jpg", "rating": 6.775, "year": "2011", "overview": "Captured by smugglers when he was just a hatchling, a macaw named Blu never learned to fly and lives a happily domesticated life in Minnesota with his human friend, Linda. Blu is thought to be the last of his kind, but when word comes that Jewel, a lone female, lives in Rio de Janeiro, Blu and Linda go to meet her. Animal smugglers kidnap Blu and Jewel, but the pair soon escape and begin a perilous adventure back to freedom -- and Linda.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P1GRO31ve5Q", "tmdb_id": 46195, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 11619, "title": "Flushed Away", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahVxu86XwxMp8RkartqY4B3mK9l.jpg", "rating": 6.349, "year": "2006", "overview": "London high-society mouse, Roddy is flushed down the toilet by Sid, a common sewer rat. Hang on for a madcap adventure deep in the sewer bowels of Ratropolis, where Roddy meets the resourceful Rita, the rodent-hating Toad and his faithful thugs, Spike and Whitey.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zTj0LvKXIO0", "tmdb_id": 11619, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 10555, "title": "Shark Tale", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r08DpyPyhXcJTfNZAICNGMzcQ8l.jpg", "rating": 6.047, "year": "2004", "overview": "Oscar is a small fish whose big aspirations often get him into trouble. Meanwhile, Lenny is a great white shark with a surprising secret that no sea creature would guess: He's a vegetarian. When a lie turns Oscar into an improbable hero and Lenny becomes an outcast, the two form an unlikely friendship.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1VX7g_4IVfU", "tmdb_id": 10555, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 379686, "title": "Space Jam: A New Legacy", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bFK5d3mVTAvBCXi5NPWH0tYjKl.jpg", "rating": 6.612, "year": "2021", "overview": "When LeBron and his young son Dom are trapped in a digital space by a rogue A.I., LeBron must get them home safe by leading Bugs, Lola Bunny and the whole gang of notoriously undisciplined Looney Tunes to victory over the A.I.'s digitized champions on the court. It's Tunes versus Goons in the highest-stakes challenge of his life.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RCsEKvz2mxs", "tmdb_id": 379686, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 1244492, "title": "Look Back", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4f2EcNkp1Mvp9wE5w7HKxcmACWg.jpg", "rating": 8.188, "year": "2024", "overview": "Popular, outgoing Fujino is celebrated by her classmates for her funny comics in the class newspaper. One day, her teacher asks her to share the space with Kyomoto, a truant recluse whose beautiful artwork sparks a competitive fervor in Fujino. What starts as jealousy transforms when Fujino realizes their shared passion for drawing.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X2aE3DtSO98", "tmdb_id": 1244492, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 598331, "title": "Rumble", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eZRgjfFWTpejRvRKyKe1EKgt9s.jpg", "rating": 6.734, "year": "2021", "overview": "In a world where monster wrestling is a global sport and monsters are superstar athletes, teenage Winnie seeks to follow in her father’s footsteps by coaching a loveable underdog monster into a champion.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hrkGNaYOv5k", "tmdb_id": 598331, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 916224, "title": "Suzume", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yStW1TXF5s7Tbtu9KjIZEaWl6HL.jpg", "rating": 7.89, "year": "2022", "overview": "Suzume, 17, lost her mother as a little girl. On her way to school, she meets a mysterious young man. But her curiosity unleashes a calamity that endangers the entire population of Japan, and so Suzume embarks on a journey to set things right.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g0JMPkn7Wuo", "tmdb_id": 916224, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 675445, "title": "PAW Patrol: The Movie", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXavWyam2VPR6bOhLwwuP3K2Hw4.jpg", "rating": 7.308, "year": "2021", "overview": "Ryder and the pups are called to Adventure City to stop Mayor Humdinger from turning the bustling metropolis into a state of chaos.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LRMTr2VZcr8", "tmdb_id": 675445, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 29826, "title": "The Legend of the Nahuala", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dggo1MOieBZsJ18qqqaT4B4VdB4.jpg", "rating": 8.053, "year": "2007", "overview": "Leo San Juan, an insecure child of nine years old, lives eternally frightened by horror stories that Nando tells his older brother. Within these stories it is 'The Legend of Nahuala', according to which, an old abandoned Casona is possessed by the spirit of an evil witch known as the Nahuala.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "", "tmdb_id": 29826, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 454640, "title": "The Angry Birds Movie 2", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebe8hJRCwdflNQbUjRrfmqtUiNi.jpg", "rating": 7.047, "year": "2019", "overview": "Red, Chuck, Bomb and the rest of their feathered friends are surprised when a green pig suggests that they put aside their differences and unite to fight a common threat. Aggressive birds from an island covered in ice are planning to use an elaborate weapon to destroy the fowl and swine.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RDj8Y2K0ODA", "tmdb_id": 454640, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 947478, "title": "The Green Dinosaur", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mnMMiwv20EL5weJrLZCaF8cM2u.jpg", "rating": 6.9, "year": "2024", "overview": "When the world around him is mysteriously erased, a little green dinosaur named Diplodocus must travel through the pages of a comic book and adventure through time to bring color back to his land. Alongside a wizard and two scientists, Diplo’s plans go awry as he learns that there may be a dimension to his world that he never considered.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cU5RwlN6c8k", "tmdb_id": 947478, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 1545621, "title": "Detective Conan: Fallen Angel of the Highway", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvOk7a7k7Sp6UdHcqV4baRlK6CC.jpg", "rating": 7.4, "year": "2026", "overview": "When a string of deadly highway incidents begin, Conan Edogawa's investigations point towards an orchestrated plot rather than mere accidents. As he uncovers a conspiracy involving hidden identities and advanced technology, the case escalates into a high-speed race against time to stop a calculating mastermind before more lives are lost.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-OmZGxr23hY", "tmdb_id": 1545621, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 268531, "title": "Captain Underpants: The First Epic Movie", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKSmaPct5OEeMoD8ue30RisHlKD.jpg", "rating": 6.316, "year": "2017", "overview": "Based on the bestselling book series, this outrageous comedy tells the story of George and Harold,  two overly imaginative pranksters who hypnotize their principal into thinking he’s an enthusiastic, yet dimwitted, superhero named Captain Underpants.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zs2SrqLum1M", "tmdb_id": 268531, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 1147416, "title": "Miraculous World: London, at the Edge of Time", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AtoMpHvs9pxd30KsyK8QmJ9W9M.jpg", "rating": 7.6, "year": "2024", "overview": "To save the future from a terrible fate, Marinette becomes Chronobug and teams up with Bunnyx to defeat a mysterious opponent who travels through time.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iFN9DouWuYY", "tmdb_id": 1147416, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 127380, "title": "Finding Dory", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UVe8NL1E2ZdUZ9EDlKGJY5UzE.jpg", "rating": 7.044, "year": "2016", "overview": "Dory is reunited with her friends Nemo and Marlin in the search for answers about her past. What can she remember? Who are her parents? And where did she learn to speak Whale?", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NQu-153MnGQ", "tmdb_id": 127380, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 459151, "title": "The Boss Baby: Family Business", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQ7huOn3F0iJCJrFezS8p9WEsri.jpg", "rating": 7.319, "year": "2021", "overview": "The Templeton brothers — Tim and his Boss Baby little bro Ted — have become adults and drifted away from each other. But a new boss baby with a cutting-edge approach and a can-do attitude is about to bring them together again … and inspire a new family business.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-rF2j6K5FoM", "tmdb_id": 459151, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 37797, "title": "Whisper of the Heart", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FROLD8zpWFs9ja7aYho1uOMJHg.jpg", "rating": 7.944, "year": "1995", "overview": "Shizuku lives a simple life, dominated by her love for stories and writing. One day she notices that all the library books she has have been previously checked out by the same person: \"Seiji Amasawa.\"", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J4lXUZTPAXg", "tmdb_id": 37797, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 228326, "title": "The Book of Life", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aotTZos5KswgCryEzx2rlOjFsm1.jpg", "rating": 7.541, "year": "2014", "overview": "The journey of Manolo, a young man who is torn between fulfilling the expectations of his family and following his heart. Before choosing which path to follow, he embarks on an incredible adventure that spans fantastical worlds where he must face his greatest fears.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_i69CJc1BgE", "tmdb_id": 228326, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 10112, "title": "The Aristocats", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOWs5XMJEABN6SKCTJBCoeD1kCA.jpg", "rating": 7.3, "year": "1970", "overview": "When Madame Adelaide Bonfamille leaves her fortune to Duchess and her children—Bonfamille’s beloved family of cats—the butler plots to steal the money and kidnaps the legatees, leaving them out on a country road. All seems lost until the wily Thomas O’Malley Cat and his jazz-playing alley cats come to the aristocats’ rescue.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h6M_OJ41NfA", "tmdb_id": 10112, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 10693, "title": "Peter Pan", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJJOs1iyrhKfZceANxoPxPwNGF1.jpg", "rating": 7.187, "year": "1953", "overview": "Leaving the safety of their nursery behind, Wendy, Michael and John follow Peter Pan to a magical world where childhood lasts forever. But while in Neverland, the kids must face Captain Hook and foil his attempts to get rid of Peter for good.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u9crctwuDLk", "tmdb_id": 10693, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 1040148, "title": "Ruby Gillman, Teenage Kraken", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ChIb3WzYAcza1vrXR56v510MWk.jpg", "rating": 7.125, "year": "2023", "overview": "Ruby Gillman, a sweet and awkward high school student, discovers she's a direct descendant of the warrior kraken queens. The kraken are sworn to protect the oceans of the world against the vain, power-hungry mermaids. Destined to inherit the throne from her commanding grandmother, Ruby must use her newfound powers to protect those she loves most.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u4uyD8FFUIw", "tmdb_id": 1040148, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 568160, "title": "Weathering with You", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgrk7r1fV4IjuoeiGS5HOhXNdLJ.jpg", "rating": 7.973, "year": "2019", "overview": "The summer of his high school freshman year, Hodaka runs away from his remote island home to Tokyo, and quickly finds himself pushed to his financial and personal limits. The weather is unusually gloomy and rainy every day, as if taking its cue from his life. After many days of solitude, he finally finds work as a freelance writer for a mysterious occult magazine. Then, one day, Hodaka meets Hina on a busy street corner. This bright and strong-willed girl possesses a strange and wonderful ability: the power to stop the rain and clear the sky.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gVFDCLSSQVM", "tmdb_id": 568160, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 838240, "title": "Robot Dreams", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ds402Qq09ybgBcXKiQNTZfzsP5o.jpg", "rating": 7.953, "year": "2023", "overview": "A lonely dog's friendship with his robot companion takes a sad turn when an unexpected malfunction forces him to abandon Robot at the beach. Will Dog ever meet Robot again?", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DD4WBGptMSw", "tmdb_id": 838240, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 614930, "title": "Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyh0eECE2IqrW8GWl3KoHBfc45j.jpg", "rating": 7.224, "year": "2023", "overview": "After years of being sheltered from the human world, the Turtle brothers set out to win the hearts of New Yorkers and be accepted as normal teenagers through heroic acts. Their new friend April O'Neil helps them take on a mysterious crime syndicate, but they soon get in over their heads when an army of mutants is unleashed upon them.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JhXRNRmuYcc", "tmdb_id": 614930, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 11360, "title": "Dumbo", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKDdllslMtsU9JixAv5HR9biXlp.jpg", "rating": 6.99, "year": "1941", "overview": "Dumbo is a baby elephant born with over-sized ears and a supreme lack of confidence. But thanks to his even more diminutive buddy Timothy the Mouse,  the pint-sized pachyderm learns to surmount all obstacles.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GPY-g86tcS4", "tmdb_id": 11360, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 313297, "title": "Kubo and the Two Strings", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/la6QA9tk4Foq8OBH2Dyh5dTcw6H.jpg", "rating": 7.65, "year": "2016", "overview": "Kubo mesmerizes the people in his village with his magical gift for spinning wild tales with origami. When he accidentally summons an evil spirit seeking vengeance, Kubo is forced to go on a quest to solve the mystery of his fallen samurai father and his mystical weaponry, as well as discover his own magical powers.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pz49Ml_rB34", "tmdb_id": 313297, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 1539104, "title": "JUJUTSU KAISEN: Execution", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0s3dx6am0RzfsuK3KdEy8ZoCDs.jpg", "rating": 6.12, "year": "2025", "overview": "A veil abruptly descends over the busy Shibuya area amid the bustling Halloween crowds, trapping countless civilians inside. Satoru Gojo, the strongest jujutsu sorcerer, steps into the chaos. But lying in wait are curse users and spirits scheming to seal him away. Yuji Itadori, accompanied by his classmates and other top-tier jujutsu sorcerers, enters the fray in an unprecedented clash of curses — the Shibuya Incident. In the aftermath, ten colonies across Japan are transformed into dens of curses in a plan orchestrated by Noritoshi Kamo. As the deadly Culling Game starts, Special Grade sorcerer Yuta Okkotsu is assigned to carry out Yuji's execution for his perceived crimes. A compilation movie of Shibuya Incident including the first two episodes of the Culling Games arc.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XeoQg5PVOLI", "tmdb_id": 1539104, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 1022796, "title": "Wish", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nesuSdJakNkf0zs7OfoasB6Clxf.jpg", "rating": 6.213, "year": "2023", "overview": "Asha, a sharp-witted idealist, makes a wish so powerful that it is answered by a cosmic force – a little ball of boundless energy called Star. Together, Asha and Star confront a most formidable foe - the ruler of Rosas, King Magnifico - to save her community and prove that when the will of one courageous human connects with the magic of the stars, wondrous things can happen.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eQPeGiCH7A0", "tmdb_id": 1022796, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 10530, "title": "Pocahontas", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZ1ft0QZ4e3zDUPMBftEkwI9ftd.jpg", "rating": 6.911, "year": "1995", "overview": "Pocahontas, daughter of a Native American tribe chief, falls in love with an English soldier as colonists invade 17th century Virginia.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mf0JmiI7NXY", "tmdb_id": 10530, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 170687, "title": "The Boxtrolls", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npBf0yc5Gt7aAyyVOcYtFyT2IPa.jpg", "rating": 6.74, "year": "2014", "overview": "An orphaned boy raised by underground creatures called Boxtrolls comes up from the sewers and out of his box to save his family and the town from the evil exterminator, Archibald Snatcher.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eduq1KghxZo", "tmdb_id": 170687, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 10009, "title": "Brother Bear", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otptPbEY0vBostmo95xwiiumMJm.jpg", "rating": 7.285, "year": "2003", "overview": "When an impulsive boy named Kenai is magically transformed into a bear, he must literally walk in another's footsteps until he learns some valuable life lessons. His courageous and often zany journey introduces him to a forest full of wildlife, including the lovable bear cub Koda, hilarious moose Rutt and Tuke, woolly mammoths and rambunctious rams.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_w897MMkjPA", "tmdb_id": 10009, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 1750432, "title": "Spidey and the Avengers: Halloween Team-Up!", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPucpn2pmszkcqRVHmrlUYK0PtG.jpg", "rating": 6.9, "year": "2026", "overview": "Spidey and the Avengers' Halloween plans are turned upside down by the mysterious Hallows' Eve, who plays magical tricks on trick or treaters and plans to ruin Halloween forever.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "", "tmdb_id": 1750432, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 12230, "title": "One Hundred and One Dalmatians", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSlYq6FrBUviGSEh8v4L9nrSnBT.jpg", "rating": 7.178, "year": "1961", "overview": "When a litter of dalmatian puppies are abducted by the minions of Cruella De Vil, the parents must find them before she uses them for a diabolical fashion statement.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d2ALWgaLypE", "tmdb_id": 12230, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 1267, "title": "Meet the Robinsons", "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naya0zF4kT401Sx15AtwB9vpcJr.jpg", "rating": 6.953, "year": "2007", "overview": "Lewis, a brilliant young inventor, is keen on creating a time machine to find his mother, who abandoned him in an orphanage. Things take a turn when he meets Wilbur Robinson and his family.", "link": "https://t.me/KiksLabMovies", "trailer": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S396-fnLldk", "tmdb_id": 1267, "_sec": "animation"}, {"id": 812225, "title": 